  "body": "*Estimated Completion Date: March 2027*\r\n\r\nFantastic news, our Zero Deposit + $10K Cashback* offer has been extended! **For a limited time**, buyers can secure a brand-new Wolfbrook home with **Zero Deposit*** needed upfront and enjoy **$10K Cashback***.\r\n\r\nWhether you're buying your first home, your next home, or investing in property, there's zero reasons to wait. **Offer ends 30 November**. *T&Cs apply.\r\n\r\n*Construction Update: Retaining walls are complete and the concrete floors have been poured, with drainage, the driveway and carpark to follow before the homes start rising out of the ground in the coming weeks.*\r\n\r\nPresenting 1 Bermuda Road, St Heliers. A stunning collection of **six architecturally designed homes,** offering the perfect blend of convenience and coastal living in one of Auckland's most desirable suburbs.\r\n\r\nThis development features standalone **three-bedroom homes,** each thoughtfully designed with **two bathrooms** and an **off-street car park** for everyday ease, offering extra room to grow.\r\n\r\nInside, these homes showcase light-filled open-plan living, contemporary kitchens, and private outdoor areas designed for both entertaining and relaxation. Generous layouts, quality finishes, and low-maintenance landscaping combine to create homes that are as practical as they are stylish.\r\n\r\nIdeal for families, first home buyers, and investors alike, 1 Bermuda Road presents an exceptional opportunity to secure a beautiful, brand-new home in a highly sought-after neighbourhood.\r\n\r\n**The Location**\r\n> Exceptionally located in **St Heliers**, just moments from **St Heliers Beach**, village shops, and eateries\r\n> Walking distance to **St Heliers Primary School**, Crossfield Reserve, and Dingle Dell Reserve\r\n> Zoned for **St Heliers School** and **Glendowie College**, with **Sacred Heart College** close by\r\n> Close to Kohimarama Beach, Madills Farm Recreation Reserve, Karaka Bay, Achilles Point, and Churchill Park\r\n> Easy access to Eastridge and Meadowbank Shopping Centres, Mission Bay, and **Auckland CBD**\r\n\r\n**Why Wolfbrook?**\r\nAs one of New Zealand's premier property developers, Wolfbrook Residential excels in delivering top-tier, tailor-made homes for homeowners and investors alike. Our track record speaks of our commitment to quality and craftsmanship. We understand that each property demands a unique approach. Wolfbrook goes beyond mere construction; we partner with you to achieve your financial goals and unlock the path to financial freedom.\r\n\r\n**Considering adding to your property portfolio?** As well as offering great tenant appeal, each home delivers an impressive gross rental yield – making it one of the smartest, turnkey buys available right now. Plus, Wolfbrook offers a ***2 Year Rental Guarantee**** when you choose to have your property professionally managed by us — giving you even greater peace of mind from day one.\r\n\r\n\r\n**Want a closer look at a completed Wolfbrook home?** Visit our Auckland showhomes at 1/15 Line Road, Glen Innes, open every Saturday from 11 am–1 pm, or 6 Flavia Close every Monday, Wednesday, Friday and Sunday from 11 am-12pm.\r\n\r\nIt's a great chance to explore the quality craftsmanship and thoughtful design that defines a Wolfbrook home. Take a walk through the finished space, meet our friendly team, and imagine what your future home could look like. We'd love to welcome you!\r\n\r\n*T&C's apply please visit https://wolfbrook.co.nz/resources/terms-conditions-zero-deposit-10k-cashback-offer",
